
 I'll provide you with a complete, production-grade engineering blueprint for building a Samsara-style fleet management platform for the Indian market. This will be a comprehensive, actionable plan from zero to deployment with hard constraints.

## Executive Summary

This is a **3-phase architecture** that starts on a single laptop with near-zero budget, migrates to a $5-10/month VPS, and eventually scales to cloud infrastructure. The stack uses **100% free, open-source tools** with Go as the primary language.

---

## Phase Architecture Overview

| Phase | Infrastructure | Monthly Cost | Scale |
|-------|---------------|--------------|-------|
| 1 | Single laptop + 5 Android phones | $0 | 5-50 vehicles |
| 2 | Cheapest VPS (Hetzner/Contabo) | $5-10 | 50-500 vehicles |
| 3 | Kubernetes cluster | $50-200+ | 500-50,000+ vehicles |

**Critical Design Principle**: All three phases use identical code, database schemas, and APIs. Only infrastructure topology changes.

---

## 1. TECHNOLOGY STACK

### 1.1 Core Stack (Go-First)

| Component | Technology | Alternative | Reasoning |
|-----------|-----------|-------------|-----------|
| **Backend** | Go 1.21+ | N/A | Required by constraint |
| **API Gateway** | Caddy (Go-based) | Nginx | Go-based, auto-HTTPS |
| **Real-time** | Centrifugo (Go) | Nats.io | Go-native, WebSocket/MQTT |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL 16 | N/A | Core relational data |
| **Time-series** | TimescaleDB (PostgreSQL ext) | InfluxDB | Free, SQL-compatible, single DB |
| **Cache** | Redis 7 | N/A | Sessions, real-time buffers |
| **Search** | Typesense (Go-based) | Elasticsearch | Go-based, simpler, free |
| **Object Storage** | MinIO (Go-based) | AWS S3 | Self-hosted S3-compatible |
| **Message Queue** | NATS (Go-based) | RabbitMQ | Go-native, edge-to-cloud |
| **Monitoring** | VictoriaMetrics + Grafana | Prometheus | More efficient storage |

### 1.2 Non-Go Components (With Justification)

| Component | Tech | Reason | Cost Impact |
|-----------|------|--------|-------------|
| **Android Apps** | Kotlin + Jetpack Compose | Android native, required for device features | $0 |
| **Firmware (OBD)** | C++ (Arduino/ESP32) | Microcontroller constraint, no Go runtime fits | $0 (DIY) |
| **Video Processing** | FFmpeg (C) | Industry standard, no Go equivalent | $0 |
| **ML/AI (Edge)** | TensorFlow Lite (Python converted) | Model inference only, not core logic | $0 |
| **OCR (Documents)** | Tesseract | Open source, Go bindings available | $0 |

### 1.3 Android MDM Stack

| Component | Technology | Cost |
|-----------|-----------|------|
| **MDM Framework** | Headwind MDM (open source) | $0 |
| **Kiosk Mode** | Android Enterprise + Headwind | $0 |
| **Remote Control** | scrcpy + custom signaling | $0 |
| **App Distribution** | F-Droid repo (self-hosted) or headwind | $0 |

