## 2. MICROSERVICES ARCHITECTURE

### 2.1 Service Decomposition (All Go)

```
fleet-platform/
├── api-gateway/          # Caddy + custom Go middleware
├── auth-service/         # JWT, RBAC, API keys
├── vehicle-service/      # Vehicle CRUD, telemetry ingestion
├── tracking-service/     # GPS processing, geofencing
├── trip-service/         # Trip lifecycle, route optimization
├── driver-service/       # Driver management, behavior scoring
├── alert-service/        # Rule engine, notifications
├── video-service/        # Dashcam, streaming, storage
├── maintenance-service/  # Predictive maintenance, diagnostics
├── fuel-service/         # Fuel monitoring, theft detection
├── logistics-service/    # Dispatch, routing, POD
├── billing-service/      # Usage-based billing, invoicing
├── integration-service/  # Fastag, E-way bill, E-challan
├── document-service/     # Vehicle docs, OCR, reminders
├── report-service/       # Analytics, exports, scheduled reports
├── notification-service/ # SMS, Email, Push (India: Exotel fallback)
├── websocket-service/    # Centrifugo wrapper for custom logic
├── ota-service/          # Firmware updates, device management
└── admin-web/            # React/Vue SPA (served by Caddy)
```

### 2.2 Communication Patterns

```
┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐
│   Devices   │────▶│  MQTT/NATS  │────▶│  Services   │
│(Android/OBD)│     │   (Edge)    │     │  (Laptop)   │
└─────────────┘     └─────────────┘     └──────┬──────┘
                                                │
                       ┌────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │  TimescaleDB    │
              │  (Telemetry)    │
              └─────────────────┘
```

**Protocol Stack:**
- **Edge to Core**: MQTT 3.1.1 (lightweight, works on 2G)
- **Service to Service**: gRPC (internal efficiency)
- **Client to API**: HTTP/2 + WebSocket
- **Real-time to Clients**: Centrifugo (WebSocket fallback to SSE)

