### 5.1 Device Setup (Headwind MDM - Open Source)

**Step-by-Step MDM Setup:**

```bash
# 1. Build Headwind MDM (on your laptop)
git clone https://github.com/hmdm/hmdm-server.git
cd hmdm-server

# Install dependencies
sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y openjdk-17-jdk maven postgresql

# Build
mvn clean install

# Configure
cp server/target/hmdm-*.war /var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/
sudo systemctl restart tomcat9

# 2. Configure Android Enterprise (free via Google, no paid GSuite)
# - Sign up at play.google.com/work with any Gmail
# - Create enterprise: https://enterprise.android.com/
# - Link to Headwind MDM

# 3. Device Enrollment
# - Factory reset Android phone
# - During setup, enter afw#hmdm (for Headwind)
# - Or scan QR code from Headwind admin panel
```

