## 8. REAL-TIME PIPELINE ARCHITECTURE

### 8.1 Why NATS + Centrifugo (Not Kafka)

| Factor | NATS + Centrifugo | Kafka |
|--------|-------------------|-------|
| **Resource Usage** | 50MB RAM, 1 CPU | 2GB+ RAM, 2+ CPUs |
| **Setup Complexity** | Single binary | Zookeeper + Brokers |
| **Edge Sync** | Built-in leaf nodes | Requires MirrorMaker |
| **Mobile Push** | Centrifugo handles it | Need separate service |
| **Go Native** | Both written in Go | Java ecosystem |
| **Phase 1 Fit** | Perfect | Overkill |

### 8.2 Local Setup (Phase 1)

```bash
# 1. Install NATS Server (single binary)
wget https://github.com/nats-io/nats-server/releases/download/v2.10.0/nats-server-v2.10.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz
tar -xzf nats-server-v2.10.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz
sudo mv nats-server /usr/local/bin/

# 2. Create config
cat > /etc/nats/nats.conf << 'EOF'
port: 4222
http_port: 8222
jetstream: true
store_dir: /var/lib/nats

# MQTT support for OBD devices
mqtt {
  port: 1883
  tls {
    cert_file: "/etc/ssl/certs/nats.crt"
    key_file: "/etc/ssl/private/nats.key"
  }
}

# Leaf node for future edge gateways
leafnodes {
  port: 7422
}
EOF

# 3. Systemd service
sudo tee /etc/systemd/system/nats.service << 'EOF'
[Unit]
Description=NATS Server
After=network.target

[Service]
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/nats-server -c /etc/nats/nats.conf
Restart=always
User=nats

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
EOF

sudo systemctl enable --now nats

# 4. Install Centrifugo (Go-based WebSocket server)
wget https://github.com/centrifugal/centrifugo/releases/download/v5.0.0/centrifugo_5.0.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz
tar -xzf centrifugo_5.0.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz
sudo mv centrifugo /usr/local/bin/

cat > /etc/centrifugo/config.json << 'EOF'
{
  "token_hmac_secret_key": "your-secret-key",
  "admin_password": "admin-pass",
  "admin_secret": "admin-secret",
  "api_key": "api-key",
  "allowed_origins": ["*"],
  "engine": "nats",
  "nats_servers": ["nats://localhost:4222"]
}
EOF

sudo tee /etc/systemd/system/centrifugo.service << 'EOF'
[Unit]
Description=Centrifugo WebSocket Server
After=nats.service

[Service]
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/centrifugo -c /etc/centrifugo/config.json
Restart=always

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
EOF

sudo systemctl enable --now centrifugo
```

### 8.3 Data Flow Architecture

```
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│ Android App  │────▶│  NATS MQTT   │────▶│  Go Service  │
│  (Driver)    │     │   (Port 1883)│     │ (Telemetry)  │
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────┬───────┘
                                                 │
                       ┌─────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │  TimescaleDB    │
              │  (Hypertables)  │
              └─────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │   Centrifugo    │◄────┐
              │  (WebSocket)    │     │
              └─────────────────┘     │
                       │              │
                       ▼              │
              ┌─────────────────┐     │
              │  Web Dashboard  │─────┘
              │  (Live Updates) │
              └─────────────────┘
```

