| **Phase 3** | 8 weeks | • Kubernetes<br>• 500+ vehicles<br>• Video AI<br>• Full India integrations | ₹5,000+/month |
| **Optimization** | Ongoing | • Cost reduction<br>• Performance tuning<br>• New features | Variable |

**Critical Path Items:**
1. **Week 1:** Database + basic GPS ingestion (blocks everything)
2. **Week 2:** Real-time pipeline (blocks map features)
3. **Week 3:** Trip lifecycle (blocks logistics features)
4. **Week 4:** MDM lockdown (blocks production deployment)

