# FASTag Integration Setup

## Provider: ICICI Bank / Paytm Payments Bank (Recommended)

### 1. Business Account Setup
Required documents:
- Company registration (GST)
- PAN card
- Cancelled cheque
- Board resolution (for corporate)

Contact: 
- ICICI: corporate.fastag@icicibank.com
- Paytm: business@paytm.com

### 2. API Credentials
Once approved, you'll receive:
- `CLIENT_ID`
- `CLIENT_SECRET`
- `MERCHANT_ID`

### 3. Configuration
```bash
# Add to /etc/fleet-platform/integration.conf
FASTAG_ENABLED=true
FASTAG_PROVIDER=icici
FASTAG_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id
FASTAG_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret
FASTAG_WEBHOOK_SECRET=generate-random-string
```

### 4. Webhook Setup
Configure endpoint in provider dashboard:
```
https://your-domain.com/webhooks/fastag/transactions
```

Headers to verify:
```
X-Webhook-Signature: HMAC-SHA256 signature
```

### 5. Test Transaction
Use test vehicle at toll plaza or sandbox environment.
```

