```markdown
# SMS Integration - Exotel (Recommended for India)

## 1. Account Setup
- Sign up: https://exotel.com
- Complete KYC (1-2 business days)
- Choose plan: Pay-as-you-go (₹0.20/SMS)

## 2. Get Credentials
Dashboard > API Settings:
- Account SID: `your-account-sid`
- API Key: `your-api-key`
- API Token: `your-api-token`
- From Number: `your-exotel-number` (e.g., 011-XXXX-XXXX)

## 3. Configuration
```yaml
# config/sms.yaml
provider: exotel
account_sid: ${EXOTEL_SID}
api_key: ${EXOTEL_KEY}
api_token: ${EXOTEL_TOKEN}
from_number: ${EXOTEL_NUMBER}
callback_url: https://your-domain.com/webhooks/sms/status
```

## 4. Template Registration
Required for transactional SMS (India TRAI regulations):

Register templates:
- `Your OTP for Fleet Login is {#var#}. Valid for 10 mins.`
- `Alert: Vehicle {#var#} has entered geofence {#var#}.`
- `SOS Alert! Driver {#var#} needs assistance. Location: {#var#}`

Approval time: 1-2 hours

## 5. Testing
```bash
curl -X POST https://api.exotel.com/v1/Accounts/{sid}/Sms/send \
  -u "{api_key}:{api_token}" \
  -d "From={exotel_number}" \
  -d "To=9876543210" \
  -d "Body=Test message from Fleet Platform"
```
```

