### 5.2 Secrets Generation Script

**File: `scripts/generate-secrets.sh`**

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Generate cryptographically secure secrets

generate_secret() {
    openssl rand -base64 48 | tr -d '\n' | cut -c1-${1:-32}
}

echo "=== Fleet Platform Secrets ==="
echo ""
echo "DB_PASSWORD=$(generate_secret 32)"
echo "JWT_SECRET=$(generate_secret 64)"
echo "NATS_PASSWORD=$(generate_secret 32)"
echo "API_KEY_SALT=$(generate_secret 32)"
echo "ENCRYPTION_KEY=$(generate_secret 32)"
echo "GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=$(generate_secret 16)"
echo ""
echo "Add these to your .env.production file"
```

