## 9. DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY

### 9.1 Phase 1: Laptop (10-50 vehicles)

**Hardware**: 1 laptop (16GB RAM, 512GB SSD), 5 Android phones

```bash
# One-command deployment
curl -fsSL https://fleet.example.com/install.sh | sudo bash -s -- \
  --domain fleet.local \
  --email admin@fleet.local \
  --phase 1
```

**Resource Allocation**:
| Service | CPU | Memory | Storage |
|---------|-----|--------|---------|
| PostgreSQL | 1 core | 512MB | 50GB |
| NATS | 0.5 core | 256MB | 10GB |
| API Server | 1 core | 512MB | - |
| Redis | 0.5 core | 256MB | - |
| System | 1 core | 1GB | - |
| **Total** | **4 cores** | **2.5GB** | **60GB** |

### 9.2 Phase 2: VPS (50-1000 vehicles)

**Hardware**: Hetzner CPX31 (4 vCPU, 16GB RAM, 160GB NVMe) - ₹1200/month

```yaml
# docker-compose.yml additions
services:
  api:
    deploy:
      replicas: 2
      resources:
        limits:
          cpus: '1.0'
          memory: 1G
  
  postgres:
    deploy:
      resources:
        limits:
          cpus: '2.0'
          memory: 4G
```

### 9.3 Phase 3: Distributed (1000-100000+ vehicles)

**Architecture**: Kubernetes cluster with regional edge nodes

```
Global Load Balancer (CloudFlare)
    ↓
Regional Clusters (Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore)
    ↓
Edge Nodes (Leaf NATS) → Local 4G connectivity
    ↓
Vehicles
```

---

## 10. SECURITY MODEL

### 10.1 Defense in Depth

| Layer | Mechanism | Implementation |
|-------|-----------|----------------|
| **Network** | Firewall, TLS 1.3 | UFW, Let's Encrypt |
| **Transport** | mTLS (service-to-service) | NATS TLS, internal CA |
| **API** | JWT, Rate limiting | 15min access, 7day refresh tokens |
| **Device** | API keys, Certificate pinning | Hardware-backed keys (Titan/TEE) |
| **Data** | Encryption at rest | LUKS (disk), AES-256-GCM (DB fields) |
| **Mobile** | Root detection, Obfuscation | SafetyNet, RASP |

### 10.2 RBAC Matrix

| Role | Vehicles | Drivers | Trips | Alerts | Settings | Billing |
|------|----------|---------|-------|--------|----------|---------|
| super_admin | CRUD | CRUD | CRUD | CRUD | CRUD | CRUD |
| admin | CRUD | CRUD | CRUD | CRUD | RU | R |
| fleet_manager | RU | RU | CRUD | CRUD | R | - |
| driver | R (assigned) | - | RU (own) | C (SOS) | - | - |
| viewer | R | R | R | R | - | - |

