## India Integration Service

The India Integration Service handles various Indian government services and compliance requirements for fleet management.

### Models Layer

- [FASTagTransaction](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L10-L32): Represents FASTag toll transactions with vehicle/driver details, amounts, and status tracking
- [EWayBill](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L34-L74): Manages E-Way Bill documents for goods transportation with compliance details
- [VehicleVerification](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L76-L108): Stores Vahan vehicle verification results with RC, insurance, and PUC details
- [DriverVerification](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L110-L135): Manages Sarathi driver license verification with class details
- [LocalPermit](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L137-L160): Handles local permits and authorizations with validity periods
- [GSTCompliance](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L162-L181): Tracks GST compliance status for organizations
- [IntegrationConfig](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/models/india.go#L183-L201): Stores API configuration for different government services

### Repository Layer

- [IndiaIntegrationRepository](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/repository/india_repository.go): Interface defining all data access methods for India integrations
- [IndiaIntegrationRepositoryImpl](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/repository/india_repository_impl.go): Implementation with full CRUD operations and complex filtering

### Service Layer

- [IndiaIntegrationService](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/service/india_service.go): Business logic with validation, error handling, and transaction management

### Handlers Layer

- [IndiaIntegrationHandlers](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/internal/handlers/india_handlers.go): HTTP handlers for all API endpoints with proper request/response handling

### Database Schema

- [Migration file](file:///home/abhishek/Desktop/flyfleet/services/india-integration-service/migrations/001_add_india_integration_tables.sql) creates tables for fastag_transactions, e_way_bills, vehicle_verifications, driver_verifications, local_permits, gst_compliances, and integration_configs with proper indexes and constraints

### API Endpoints

- FASTag: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/fastag/transactions
- E-Way Bill: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/ewaybill/bills
- Vahan: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/vahan/verifications
- Sarathi: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/sarathi/verifications
- Permits: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/permits
- GST: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/gst/compliances
- Config: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/config

### Deployment Readiness

The India Integration Service is complete and ready for deployment with all necessary components implemented.

### Core Capabilities

- FASTag transaction management and reconciliation
- E-Way Bill generation and tracking
- Vehicle verification via Vahan integration
- Driver verification via Sarathi integration
- Local permit management
- GST compliance tracking
- Secure API configuration management
